### server testing
GET http://localhost:3000

### get all songs
GET http://localhost:3000/songs

### add a new song
POST http://localhost:3000/songs/add

### get a specific song
GET http://localhost:3000/songs/1234

### update a song
PUT http://localhost:3000/songs/update/1234

### delete a song
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/songs/delete/1234